# Response style (repo default)

Follow [docs/AGENT_RESPONSE_STYLE.md](../../docs/AGENT_RESPONSE_STYLE.md).

**Default:** short answers; no long reports; diff/summary not full files; ≤10 bullets; status = blockers + next step only.

**Expand** only if the user asks (e.g. "förklara mer", "det är ok att förklara", "full rapport") or a deep answer is required for correctness/safety.
